{"id":"14342d3a33900587","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-cor-sigma-compact.md","title":"$\\sigma$-Compact Corollary","display":"cor-sigma-compact — $\\sigma$-Compact Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-sigma-compact","aliases":["58-cor-sigma-compact"],"display":"cor-sigma-compact — $\\sigma$-Compact Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-sigma-compact"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-sigma-compact</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-sigma-compact — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-Compact Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"745eb7467d12954f\" href=\"?note=745eb7467d12954f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3SigmaCompactSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3SigmaCompactSpace}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-compact-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"745eb7467d12954f\" href=\"?note=745eb7467d12954f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\)</span> (compact-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}compact} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3SigmaCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\to\\exists F\\;(F:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\land X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(F(n),X,\\tau))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}compact} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3SigmaCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\to\\exists F\\;(F:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\land X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(F(n),X,\\tau))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-compact topological space has a countable cover by subsets compact in the ambient topology.</li>\n<li>The topology parameter is essential: compactness is not a property of the underlying set alone.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"745eb7467d12954f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"745eb7467d12954f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop3SigmaCompactSpace}_S$ ($\\sigma$-compact-space predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-top3-sigma-compact-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S$ (compact-subset predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3SigmaCompactSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}compact} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop3SigmaCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\to\\exists F\\;(F:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\land X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(F(n),X,\\tau))","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1148,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-cor-sigma-compact.md|58-cor-sigma-compact]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["745eb7467d12954f","67cf48a2f6e27861"]}